# Autocomplete

Get search suggestions and math evaluations through the current transport, or drop in the `<Autocomplete>` component.

## Method Usage

```svelte
<script>
  import Chemical from "chemicaljs/Chemical";

  let chemical = $state();
  let ready = $state(false);

  async function getSuggestions() {
    if (!ready) return;
    const results = await chemical.autocomplete("math");
    console.log(results);
  }
</script>

<Chemical bind:ready bind:this={chemical}/>
```

## Response Format

Results are returned as an array of objects with `math`, `plain`, and `rich` entries:

```json
[
  {
    "type": "math",
    "data": {
      "equation": "1+1",
      "result": "2"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "plain",
    "data": [
      { "text": "g", "highlight": false },
      { "text": "mail", "highlight": true }
    ],
    "fullURL": "gmail"
  },
  {
    "type": "rich",
    "data": {
      "title": "Google",
      "description": "Search the world's information.",
      "image": "data:image/png;base64,..."
    }
  }
]
```

## Autocomplete Component

Import `<Autocomplete>` from `chemicaljs/Autocomplete` for standalone use, or from `chemicaljs/tabs` to automatically bind to `<Tabs>` and `<AddressBar>`.

```svelte
<script>
  import Chemical from "chemicaljs/Chemical";
  import Autocomplete from "chemicaljs/Autocomplete";

  let chemical = $state();
  let ready = $state(false);
  let ac = $state();
  let query = $state("");
  let open = $state(false);
</script>

<Chemical bind:ready bind:this={chemical}/>

<input
  bind:value={query}
  onfocus={() => (open = true)}
  onblur={() => (open = false)}
  onkeydown={(e) => ac?.handleKeydown(e)}
/>

<Autocomplete bind:this={ac} onselect="{(val)" {chemical} {open} {query} {ready}> {
    query = val;
    open = false;
  }}
/>
```

### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `chemical` | `object` | Tabs context | `Chemical` component instance. |
| `ready` | `boolean` | `true` / Tabs context | Prevents requests before Chemical is ready. |
| `search` | `(query) => Promise<any[]>` | `undefined` | Custom async suggestion provider. |
| `query` | `string` | Tabs context | Current search text. Omit inside `<Tabs>` to auto-bind. |
| `open` | `boolean` | `true` / Tabs context | Controls dropdown visibility. |
| `debounce` | `number` | `150` | Debounce delay in milliseconds. |
| `limit` | `number` | `8` | Maximum number of suggestions shown (`0` for unlimited). |
| `getValue` | `(entry) => string` | Built-in extractor | Maps a suggestion entry to its string value. |
| `onselect` | `(value, entry) => void` | `undefined` | Fires when a suggestion is selected. |
| `onhighlight` | `(value, entry, index) => void` | `undefined` | Fires when arrow navigation changes the active option. |
| `item` | `Snippet` | Built-in renderer | Custom option template receiving `{ item, value, active, index, select }`. |

### Methods

* `ac.isOpen()` — returns whether the listbox is currently visible.
* `ac.move(delta)` — moves highlight by `1` or `-1`.
* `ac.select(index)` / `ac.selectActive()` — selects an item.
* `ac.close()` — dismisses the dropdown.
* `ac.handleKeydown(e)` — handles `ArrowDown`, `ArrowUp`, `Enter`, and `Escape`; returns `true` if handled.

### Styling Hooks

* `li[data-active]` — currently highlighted option.
* `li[data-type="math" | "rich" | "plain"]` — suggestion type.
* `[data-ac-equation]`, `[data-ac-result]` — math result elements.
* `[data-ac-image]`, `[data-ac-text]`, `[data-ac-title]`, `[data-ac-description]` — rich result elements.
* `[data-ac-plain]` — plain text suggestion wrapper.
